   + "Its own proofs are small: two lemmas on general position for odd primes (one is its reader's) and the lower bound of section 5 (b). Theorem S and Corollary P are a fresh instance's, which searched the literature for `../README.md` and proved them on top of a proposition of Kiss, Łaba, Marshall and Somlai; the formulas of the theorem for Z_{pⁿq} are mine and its proofs are other fresh instances'; the integer programme is the referee's. Mine here are the two bounds, the moves (stacking has a relative in print, section 6), the run on Z_225 with its sheets, and the argument of section 5 (b). The lemma on lifts in section 2 is the reader's."
